-- SHADOW-SEMANTICS cell I32 provider 2: the standalone `main.mdk` selectively
-- imports.  `Eq a => b -> a -> String` is NOT alpha-equivalent to the method's
-- `Debug a => t -> a -> String`: the two constraint lists are the same LENGTH and
-- the two bodies do correspond, so a comparison that measures only the length
-- reports these as the same scheme.
export tagOf : Eq a => b -> a -> String
tagOf _ _ = "prov"
